sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Administrador
    participant Front as Frontend (Dashboard)
    participant S1 as Servicio 1 (API Admin)
    participant Redis as Redis Stream
    participant S2 as Servicio 2 (Motor UFW)
    participant UFW as Firewall UFW

    Admin->>Front: Presiona botón "Desbanear IP"
    Front->>S1: POST /api/v1/ips/unban { "ip": "192.168.1.50" }
    S1->>S1: Valida sesión y formato de IP
    S1->>Redis: XADD security:events:unban * action UNBAN ip 192.168.1.50 requested_by admin timestamp 1724851200
    Redis-->>S1: Retorna ID del evento (ej: 1724851200000-0)
    S1-->>Front: HTTP 202 Accepted (Petición en cola)
    Front-->>Admin: Notifica "Orden de desbaneo enviada"

    loop Consumer Group Polling
        S2->>Redis: XREADGROUP GROUP ufw_workers consumer_1 STREAMS security:events:unban >
        Redis-->>S2: Entrega evento UNBAN (IP: 192.168.1.50)
        S2->>UFW: ufw delete deny from 192.168.1.50
        UFW-->>S2: Confirmación de regla removida
        S2->>Redis: Actualiza estado en Hash de IPs & XACK security:events:unban ufw_workers 1724851200000-0
    end
